  "description": "What if every planet had a heart?\n\nIn Planet Romance Girls: Conquer the Zodiac Horoscope, the solar system comes to life... literally.\n\nEach planet takes human form as a mysterious, beautiful girl shaped by cosmic energy and emotion.\n\nAs you get closer, they begin to humanise—their celestial glow softening as real feelings awaken.\nBut love between a mortal and a planet was never meant to be simple…\n\nWill you teach the stars what love truly means, or will the universe shatter your heart first?\n\n\nGame Features\n\n● Date the planets themselves – Mercury’s charm, Venus’s allure, Saturn’s mystery… each world hides a girl with a soul to discover.\n\n● Watch them transform – Your choices awaken emotions that turn planets into humans—body and heart.\n\n● Zodiac romance simulator – A surreal, cosmic journey through astrology, destiny, and desire.\n\n● Multiple endings – Will your love rewrite the constellations… or fade into stardust?\n\n\nIt’s magical.\nIt’s cosmic.\nIt’s love written in the stars.\n\nAre you ready to fall for the planets?",
